Adapted files, all modified from the originals:

  app/src/main/java/eu/kanade/tachiyomi/**
    The source API (eu.kanade.tachiyomi.source), its HTTP helpers
    (eu.kanade.tachiyomi.network) and the Jsoup helpers. The package names are
    kept deliberately so extensions built against the Tachiyomi/Mihon
    extensions-lib can be loaded unchanged. Trimmed to the parts Folio uses:
    there is no DNS-over-HTTPS selection and no dependency injection framework
    beyond Injekt.

  app/src/main/java/app/folio/manga/**
    The source registry, extension loader and download manager, rewritten
    against Folio's own container, Room database and file access rather than
    Mihon's.

  app/src/main/java/app/folio/core/model/ChapterRecognition.kt
  app/src/test/java/app/folio/core/model/ChapterRecognitionTest.kt
  app/src/main/java/app/folio/core/model/ChapterSanitizer.kt
    Ported from Mihon with only the chapter type changed to Folio's own, so
    chapter numbers and names come out as they do in Mihon. The chapter sync
    rules in MangaChapterSync.kt follow Mihon's SyncChaptersWithSource.

  app/src/main/java/app/folio/ui/screens/manga/SourceSettingsScreen.kt
    The source preference fragment, after Mihon's SourcePreferencesScreen.

